        "explain": "Were it not for… — ‘not’ goes after ‘it’, never ‘Weren’t it’."
      },
      {
        "use": "Negative",
        "before": "Should you",
        "after": "receive the parcel by Friday, please call us.",
        "hint": "not",
        "answers": [
          "not"
